      "jcr:created": "Wed Feb 11 2026 22:39:49 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Simple design</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Apply, seal, pinch</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">NPseal simplifies negative pressure wound therapy with a three-step application process—apply, seal and pinch. Once applied, patients can manage their own therapy confidently thanks to the integrated pinch pump that establishes and maintains negative pressure with a few pinches. NPseal may be worn for up to seven days,<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;though a change may be needed sooner depending on wound conditions.&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
